@GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress = https://localhost:7136

# Sign in through the browser first (GET /login), then copy the full Cookie header
# (app_session, app_sessionC1, app_sessionC2) into the variable below.
@sessionCookie = app_session=chunks-2; app_sessionC1=...; app_sessionC2=...

### Who am I
GET {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/me
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Accept: application/json

### SCIM2 profile
GET {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Accept: application/json

### Select role after first login
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/select-role
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "Rider" }

### SCRUM-35 — deactivate without confirming (expect 400)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/account/deactivate
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": false }

### SCRUM-35 — deactivate my account (expect 200, session cookie cleared; 409 while a trip is active)
# Irreversible from the app: only an Asgardeo admin can re-enable the account afterwards.
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/account/deactivate
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": true }

### SCRUM-35 — anonymous caller (expect 401)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/account/deactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "confirm": true }

### SCRUM-42 — create the driver profile first (Driver session; expect 200, 409 if it exists)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/driver/addProfile
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleMake": "Toyota",
  "vehicleModel": "Aqua",
  "vehiclePlate": "CAB-1234",
  "vehicleTypeCode": "car",
  "licenseNumber": "B1234567",
  "licenseExpiry": "2030-12-31"
}

### SCRUM-42 — invalid profile data (expect 400 with field errors, nothing saved)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/driver/addProfile
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vehicleMake": "T", "vehicleModel": "", "vehiclePlate": "AB", "vehicleTypeCode": "car", "licenseNumber": "123", "licenseExpiry": "2020-01-01" }

### SCRUM-42 — upload a document (expect 200; pick a real JPEG/PNG/PDF under 5 MB)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/driver/documents
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----GoRide

------GoRide
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

DrivingLicence
------GoRide
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentNumber"

B1234567
------GoRide
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="expiresOn"

2031-06-30
------GoRide
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="licence.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./licence.jpg
------GoRide--

### SCRUM-42 — my profile with documents and verification state (replace {sub} with your user id)
GET {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/driver/{sub}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### SCRUM-43 — driver: verification state as the app must enforce it
GET {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/driver/verification-status
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### SCRUM-43 — driver: go online (expect 403 until approved, 200 afterwards)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/driver/go-online
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### SCRUM-43 — admin: approve a driver (Admin session; expect 200, 409 while documents are missing)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/admin/drivers/{driverId}/approve
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Documents verified" }

### SCRUM-43 — admin: reject a driver with a reason (expect 200; 400 without a reason)
POST {{GoRide.IdentityAuth_HostAddress}}/api/admin/drivers/{driverId}/reject
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Insurance policy has expired; upload a current one." }
